WEBVTT

00:19:58.204 --> 00:20:01.079
I was like thirteen and a half.
I sort of fudged my age.

00:20:01.329 --> 00:20:03.496
I think you had to be 14 to actually work.

00:20:03.496 --> 00:20:10.038
But by 13, I worked as a full time job as
a janitor's assistant and in my school,

00:20:10.621 --> 00:20:13.829
cleaning the books that the shelves
and the drawers and

00:20:13.829 --> 00:20:16.371
the desk getting gum off
of things and painting.

00:20:16.829 --> 00:20:19.163
It was through this program
for low income kids.

00:20:19.746 --> 00:20:22.954
You know, I worked and I earned my
money and I bought my stuff.

00:20:22.954 --> 00:20:25.163
That's that was part of the
whole plan, you know,

00:20:25.413 --> 00:20:31.079
that I would get it myself if it couldn't
be provided for me. Sometimes I.